  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "저... 저기...\n도와주세요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800002E002E002E0020C800AE30002E002E002E000AB3C4C640C8FCC138C694002E002E002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쌔비냥을 좋아하는 여성분과\n데이트를 할 건데요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C314BE44B0E5C7440020C88BC544D558B2940020C5ECC131BD84ACFC000AB370C774D2B8B97C0020D5600020AC74B370C694002E002E002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너무 긴장돼서 말을 제대로 못 하겠어요.\n그러니까 부탁드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108BB340020AE34C7A5B3FCC11C0020B9D0C7440020C81CB300B85C0020BABB0020D558ACA0C5B4C694002E000AADF8B7ECB2C8AE4C0020BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여성분과 대화를 이어 가게 도와주세요!\n부탁이에요! 제발요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECC131BD84ACFC0020B300D654B97C0020C774C5B40020AC00AC8C0020B3C4C640C8FCC138C6940021000ABD80D0C1C774C5D0C69400210020C81CBC1CC694002100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "준비가 되시면 제게 말을 걸어 주세요.\n제발 부탁드릴게요...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C900BE44AC000020B418C2DCBA740020C81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E000AC81CBC1C0020BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002E002E002E002100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저를 도와주실 준비는 되셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B97C0020B3C4C640C8FCC2E40020C900BE44B2940020B418C168B098C694003F00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맡겨만 주세요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9E1ACA8B9CC0020C8FCC138C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도와주실 거면 빨리 부탁드릴게요.\n너무 긴장돼서 심장이 터질 것 같아요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4C640C8FCC2E40020AC70BA740020BE68B9AC0020BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002E000AB108BB340020AE34C7A5B3FCC11C0020C2ECC7A5C7740020D130C9C80020AC830020AC19C544C694002E002E002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자... 잘 부탁드립니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002E002E002E0020C7980020BD80D0C1B4DCB9BDB2C8B2E4002100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쌔비냥을 정말로 좋아하는 분이시거든요...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그래서 저도 잡았는데,\n방금 막 잡아서 아는 게 별로 없어요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C314BE44B0E5C7440020C815B9D0B85C0020C88BC544D558B2940020BD84C774C2DCAC70B4E0C694002E002E002E00100001BE01000AADF8B798C11C0020C800B3C40020C7A1C558B294B370002C000ABC29AE080020B9C90020C7A1C544C11C0020C544B2940020AC8C0020BCC4B85C0020C5C6C5B4C694002E002E002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니까 저랑 가까운 곳에 앉아서\n필요할 때마다 도와주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C8AE4C0020C800B7910020AC00AE4CC6B40020ACF3C5D00020C549C544C11C000AD544C694D5600020B54CB9C8B2E40020B3C4C640C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "곧 있으면 도착하실 거예요...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n제가 대답을 머뭇거리는 것 같으면\n자연스럽게 힌트를 가르쳐 주세요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE70020C788C73CBA740020B3C4CC29D558C2E40020AC70C608C694002E002E002E00100001BE01000AC81CAC000020B300B2F5C7440020BA38BB47AC70B9ACB2940020AC830020AC19C73CBA74000AC790C5F0C2A4B7FDAC8C0020D78CD2B8B97C0020AC00B974CCD00020C8FCC138C694002E002E002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 멋진 카페와 쌔비냥이네요!\n대화까지 재미있으면 금상첨화겠는데요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020BA4BC9C40020CE74D398C6400020C314BE44B0E5C774B124C6940021000AB300D654AE4CC9C00020C7ACBBF8C788C73CBA740020AE08C0C1CCA8D654ACA0B294B370C694002100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쌔비냥이 무슨 포켓몬인지는 아시죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C314BE44B0E5C7740020BB34C2A80020D3ECCF13BAACC778C9C0B2940020C544C2DCC8E0003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "성악포켓몬",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C131C545D3ECCF13BAAC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냉혹포켓몬",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0C9D639D3ECCF13BAAC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "위협포켓몬",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C704D611D3ECCF13BAAC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맞았어요! 성미가 악해서 성악이라니,\n쌔비냥을 잘 표현하는 것 같지 않아요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DEC558C5B4C69400210020C131BBF8AC000020C545D574C11C0020C131C545C774B77CB2C8002C000AC314BE44B0E5C7440020C7980020D45CD604D558B2940020AC830020AC19C9C00020C54AC544C694003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그랬었나...?\n뭔가 쌔비냥과 안 어울리는 것 같은데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ACC5C8B098002E002E002E003F000ABB54AC000020C314BE44B0E5ACFC0020C5480020C5B4C6B8B9ACB2940020AC830020AC19C740B370002E002E002E00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쌔비냥이 사람의 물건을\n훔치는 이유가 뭔지 아세요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C314BE44B0E5C7740020C0ACB78CC7580020BB3CAC74C744000AD6D4CE58B2940020C774C720AC000020BB54C9C00020C544C138C694003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "생존을 위해",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0DDC874C7440020C704D5740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "장난을 치기 위해",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A5B09CC7440020CE58AE300020C704D5740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트레이너를 싫어해서",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B808C774B108B97C0020C2EBC5B4D574C11C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맞았어요! 그래서 쌔비냥과 함께 있으면\n스릴 넘치는 매일을 즐길 수 있다니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DEC558C5B4C69400210020ADF8B798C11C0020C314BE44B0E5ACFC0020D568AED80020C788C73CBA74000AC2A4B9B40020B118CE58B2940020B9E4C77CC7440020C990AE380020C2180020C788B2E4B2C8AE4CC694002100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그랬었나...?\n쌔비냥은 좀 더 자유분방한 느낌인데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ACC5C8B098002E002E002E003F000AC314BE44B0E5C7400020C8800020B3540020C790C720BD84BC29D55C0020B290B08CC778B370002E002E002E00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 이 중에서\n쌔비냥이 배울 수 없는 기술이 뭔지 아세요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020C7740020C911C5D0C11C000AC314BE44B0E5C7740020BC30C6B80020C2180020C5C6B2940020AE30C220C7740020BB54C9C00020C544C138C694003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트집",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8C9D10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나쁜음모",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C05CC74CBAA80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "속임수",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C18DC784C2180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맞았어요! 배울 수 있을 것 같은데\n실제로는 못 배운다는 게 재미있지 않아요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DEC558C5B4C69400210020BC30C6B80020C2180020C788C7440020AC830020AC19C740B370000AC2E4C81CB85CB2940020BABB0020BC30C6B4B2E4B2940020AC8C0020C7ACBBF8C788C9C00020C54AC544C694003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그랬었나...?\n그 기술은 쌔비냥이 쓸 수 있는 것 같은데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ACC5C8B098002E002E002E003F000AADF80020AE30C220C7400020C314BE44B0E5C7740020C4F80020C2180020C788B2940020AC830020AC19C740B370002E002E002E00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 둘 다 쌔비냥을 좋아해서 그런가\n이야기하는 것도 즐겁네요~!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020B4580020B2E40020C314BE44B0E5C7440020C88BC544D574C11C0020ADF8B7F0AC00000AC774C57CAE30D558B2940020AC83B3C40020C990AC81B124C694007E002100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저... 저기...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n쌔비냥도 르샤 씨가\n마음에 든 모양이고...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800002E002E002E0020C800AE30002E002E002E00100001BE01000AC314BE44B0E5B3C40020B974C0E40020C528AC00000AB9C8C74CC5D00020B4E00020BAA8C591C774ACE0002E002E002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저도 같이 이야기해서 정말 즐거웠어요...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그러니까, 괜찮으시다면...\n다음에 또 만나 주시면... 좋겠어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B3C40020AC19C7740020C774C57CAE30D574C11C0020C815B9D00020C990AC70C6E0C5B4C694002E002E002E00100001BE01000AADF8B7ECB2C8AE4C002C0020AD1CCC2EC73CC2DCB2E4BA74002E002E002E000AB2E4C74CC5D00020B6100020B9CCB0980020C8FCC2DCBA74002E002E002E0020C88BACA0C5B4C694002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "음~ 쌔비냥 토크로 즐겁게 이야기하기에는\n조금 미묘했던 것 같기도?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그럼, 이만 실례할게요~!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C74C007E0020C314BE44B0E50020D1A0D06CB85C0020C990AC81AC8C0020C774C57CAE30D558AE30C5D0B294000AC870AE080020BBF8BB18D588B3580020AC830020AC19AE30B3C4003F00100001BE00000AADF8B7FC002C0020C774B9CC0020C2E4B840D560AC8CC694007E002100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "의뢰인은...\n눈앞이 캄캄해졌다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C758B8B0C778C740002E002E002E000AB208C55EC7740020CE84CE84D574C84CB2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n다음에 또 쌔비냥에 대해 이야기해 봐요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544C694002100100001BE01000AB2E4C74CC5D00020B6100020C314BE44B0E5C5D00020B300D5740020C774C57CAE30D5740020BD10C694002100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가... 감사합니다!\n저기... 잠깐 자리 좀 비울게요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00002E002E002E0020AC10C0ACD569B2C8B2E40021000AC800AE30002E002E002E0020C7A0AE500020C790B9AC0020C8800020BE44C6B8AC8CC694002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "도와주셔서 감사해요.\n저는 하나도 모르겠더라구요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C4C640C8FCC154C11C0020AC10C0ACD574C694002E000AC800B2940020D558B098B3C40020BAA8B974ACA0B354B77CAD6CC694002E002E002E00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "덕분에 다음에도 만날 수 있게 됐어요!\n이건 감사의 뜻으로 드리는 거예요...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 3024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B355BD84C5D00020B2E4C74CC5D0B3C40020B9CCB0A00020C2180020C788AC8C0020B410C5B4C6940021000AC774AC740020AC10C0ACC7580020B73BC73CB85C0020B4DCB9ACB2940020AC70C608C694002E002E002E002100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이제부터 배웅해 드리러 가야 하는데,\n또 쌔비냥 이야기가 나오면 어쩌죠?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C81CBD80D1300020BC30C6C5D5740020B4DCB9ACB7EC0020AC00C57C0020D558B294B370002C000AB6100020C314BE44B0E50020C774C57CAE30AC000020B098C624BA740020C5B4CA4CC8E0003F00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 3216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여전히 긴장되긴 하지만 할 말이 안 떠오르면\n상대분이 좋아하는 것을 물어보거나,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n제 이야기를 조금씩 하면 되지 않을까요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 3228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "냐아.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0D0C544002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "남자분이 긴장할 때마다 쌔비냥이\n대화를 자연스럽게 이어 가게 해 줘요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n정말 멋진 쌔비냥을 잡으신 것 같아요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
